WEBVTT

00:01:45.366 --> 00:01:46.366
Kluke!

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:48.600
Let's take this one.

00:02:00.633 --> 00:02:05.033
I'll listen whenever you're ready to
talk about the truth, Zola.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.000
Logi!

00:02:07.133 --> 00:02:08.133
Kluke!

00:02:16.033 --> 00:02:17.033
Kluke!

00:02:17.066 --> 00:02:18.066
Kluke!

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.870
She might not look it, but she's still
a descendant of the Soldiers of Light...

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.500
Let's make sure she
can't use her Shadow.

00:02:28.766 --> 00:02:33.226
I'll get her to tell us what she knows
about Shadows and Zola.

00:02:33.366 --> 00:02:38.266
BIRD IN A CAGE

00:02:42.233 --> 00:02:43.833
How can you say that?!

00:02:44.366 --> 00:02:48.696
We have to go after them right now.
And we have to save Kluke!

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:52.670
I understand how you feel.
But we can't do that.

00:02:52.866 --> 00:02:54.066
Why not?!

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:57.170
Then let me ask you this.
Where are they?

00:02:58.933 --> 00:03:02.933
They kidnapped Kluke
for information.

00:03:03.433 --> 00:03:06.173
Her life is not in immediate
danger at this point.

00:03:06.566 --> 00:03:09.496
That being said,
we can't just leave her, right?

00:03:11.266 --> 00:03:13.966
Zola, are you going to
just abandon her?!

00:03:14.266 --> 00:03:15.496
That's not what I'm saying.

00:03:15.966 --> 00:03:19.266
I'm just saying that we should
wait for the right moment.

00:03:21.933 --> 00:03:23.933
What do you mean, Zola?

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:01.830
Where am I?

00:04:03.666 --> 00:04:05.666
That's right... I was...

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:07.600
Kluke!

00:04:08.133 --> 00:04:09.933
Help me, Shu!

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.030
Phoenix!

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:24.430
Unfortunately,

00:04:27.133 --> 00:04:28.603
you can't summon your Shadow.

00:04:29.633 --> 00:04:30.303
You?!

00:04:31.333 --> 00:04:33.333
My name's Andropov.

00:04:33.866 --> 00:04:34.866
Pleased to meet you.

00:04:35.633 --> 00:04:39.873
That bracelet has a function that
suppresses the power of the Shadow.

00:04:40.766 --> 00:04:43.526
So basically,
you're like a bird in a cage.

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:46.270
You're with
General Logi, right?

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:47.770
Yeah.

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:50.130
Your name's Kluke, right?

00:04:50.666 --> 00:04:52.066
How do you know my name?

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:56.770
Oh, uh, my main duty
is to gather information.

00:04:57.333 --> 00:04:58.873
So of course I know your name.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:05.470
- Um...
- Um...

00:05:05.733 --> 00:05:06.903
W-What?!

00:05:07.233 --> 00:05:09.333
No, you go ahead.

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:10.970
Ahem.

00:05:12.066 --> 00:05:13.066
Andropov...

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.600
Y-Yeah, I know.

00:05:18.833 --> 00:05:21.603
Come with me.
General Logi wants to see you.

00:05:28.266 --> 00:05:30.726
What's going to
happen to me?

00:05:31.466 --> 00:05:34.196
I bet they'll take me to
some dark, damp place and...

00:05:36.233 --> 00:05:37.203
Talk!

00:05:37.666 --> 00:05:40.396
Nothing good will come
from being stubborn!

00:05:40.533 --> 00:05:44.233
I'm sorry! I did it!

00:05:44.466 --> 00:05:45.596
Or maybe...

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:48.030
it's something
like this...

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:51.030
No!

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:53.400
Or this...

00:05:53.533 --> 00:05:54.773
Get to work!

00:05:54.933 --> 00:05:57.503
I'm hungry!

00:05:58.466 --> 00:06:00.466
And then in the end...

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.900
I've turned into
a robot!

00:06:07.133 --> 00:06:09.373
That's what'll happen...

00:06:10.066 --> 00:06:11.066
We're here.

00:06:28.133 --> 00:06:31.403
Damn it.
Why did Zola have to say that?

00:06:32.333 --> 00:06:33.403
Damn it!

00:06:39.633 --> 00:06:40.303
Shu.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.270
W-What is it?!

00:06:47.533 --> 00:06:49.033
It'll be okay, Shu.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.300
What will?

00:06:50.333 --> 00:06:54.073
I'm sure Zola is keeping
Kluke in mind.

00:06:57.033 --> 00:06:58.873
So I'm sure it'll be okay.

00:07:00.433 --> 00:07:01.503
I don't know...

00:07:01.866 --> 00:07:03.626
Cheer up, Shu.

00:07:04.833 --> 00:07:05.973
If you don't,

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:10.230
I'll be sad too!

00:07:11.133 --> 00:07:12.403
Come on, Shu.

00:07:12.433 --> 00:07:14.673
- I'll cheer you up...
- Cut it out!

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.130
Cut it out, I say!

00:07:17.433 --> 00:07:19.403
- Get away!
- Oh, Shu!

00:07:19.433 --> 00:07:20.433
I can't breathe.

00:07:21.866 --> 00:07:22.996
Oh, Shu!

00:07:23.166 --> 00:07:25.766
What're you guys doing, maro?

00:07:26.166 --> 00:07:26.826
- Oh.
- Oh.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:28.170
Maro?

00:07:34.966 --> 00:07:36.266
Make yourself comfortable.

00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:39.003
Uh, okay.

00:07:40.133 --> 00:07:41.503
Now, shall we begin?

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:44.130
Umm, are you
going to do it here?

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:47.930
It seems you've gotten
the wrong idea about us.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:48.770
Huh?

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:50.570
Think about it.

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:54.400
Your Shadow powers
have been sealed.

00:07:55.333 --> 00:07:58.873
There's no need to be
excessively cautious with you.

00:07:59.166 --> 00:08:00.226
Uh-huh.

00:08:00.333 --> 00:08:05.433
And one must be careful
when handling a lady.

00:08:06.333 --> 00:08:07.003
You snob.

00:08:09.733 --> 00:08:11.503
You're a strong-minded girl.

00:08:12.366 --> 00:08:14.666
I'm going to ask you
several questions.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:18.500
I'd like you to answer them
honestly if you can.

00:08:18.933 --> 00:08:21.133
I don't think it'll go that easily.

00:08:23.433 --> 00:08:25.103
I'll ask point blank.

00:08:25.933 --> 00:08:27.733
What is Zola planning to do?

00:08:28.933 --> 00:08:29.933
Zola?

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:37.730
I think she's trying to restore peace to
the world by defeating people like you.

00:08:38.266 --> 00:08:40.596
Is that what you really think?

00:08:40.866 --> 00:08:41.866
Of course!

00:08:42.266 --> 00:08:46.726
To prove it, we actually defeated Nene
by working together with Zola.

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:50.170
This is a surprise.

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:53.430
I never thought she'd win
you guys over this much.

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:56.070
Could you please stop
making rude comments?

00:08:56.533 --> 00:08:57.533
My apologies.

00:08:58.133 --> 00:09:01.373
It looks like I have to
approach this differently.

00:09:02.833 --> 00:09:05.833
How did you come to know Zola?

00:09:06.733 --> 00:09:07.833
How?

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:11.470
She came to our village...

00:09:12.566 --> 00:09:15.466
At first she said the village
didn't matter to her.

00:09:15.866 --> 00:09:17.626
But in the end, she saved us.

00:09:18.166 --> 00:09:21.226
Why did Zola come
to your village?

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:24.100
Well, to check out the ruins...

00:09:24.566 --> 00:09:26.126
No, that's not it.

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:28.830
She came looking for you.

00:09:29.333 --> 00:09:30.333
You're wrong!

00:09:30.666 --> 00:09:33.566
I couldn't even use
my power back then.

00:09:34.166 --> 00:09:36.526
I was just with Shu.

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:42.630
Oh, so Shu lived in
the same village as you, huh?

00:09:42.933 --> 00:09:43.603
Oh...

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:46.130
How did you meet
your other friends?

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:48.030
I don't want to answer that.

00:09:49.466 --> 00:09:50.466
Fair enough.

00:09:51.133 --> 00:09:52.133
But still,

00:09:53.633 --> 00:09:57.933
when you guys entered
the base I was stationed,

00:09:57.966 --> 00:10:00.466
you already had five members
in your group.

00:10:01.233 --> 00:10:04.773
There was one additional member
with you when we met next.

00:10:05.266 --> 00:10:07.796
I can't just dismiss that
as a coincidence.

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:09.130
Why's that?

00:10:09.366 --> 00:10:12.026
Zola was clearly traveling
to assemble

00:10:12.066 --> 00:10:15.566
the descendents of
the seven Soldiers of Light.

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:20.370
And she's attempting to use
their powers for something.

00:10:20.566 --> 00:10:21.666
No, that can't be!

00:10:21.966 --> 00:10:24.696
We all chose to come on
this journey of our own free will!

00:10:26.433 --> 00:10:29.003
Zola's a very shrewd woman.

00:10:29.133 --> 00:10:31.573
She's pulling your strings.

00:10:32.666 --> 00:10:33.666
That could never be.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.600
Because back then...

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:46.400
I can't lose them here.

00:10:47.566 --> 00:10:49.926
I will...protect.

00:10:50.866 --> 00:10:52.966
I will protect them,
if it's the last thing I do!

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:54.200
Zola!

00:10:54.633 --> 00:10:56.133
You're missing the point.

00:10:56.733 --> 00:11:00.303
Don't forget it was Zola who got you
in that situation in the first place.

00:11:01.233 --> 00:11:02.233
Well...

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:06.030
Why did she maneuver you guys
into a battle against Nene

00:11:06.066 --> 00:11:08.726
when it was clear that
you were overmatched?

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:14.200
One can only assume
she had another agenda.

00:11:17.966 --> 00:11:19.026
Could it be?

00:11:31.266 --> 00:11:32.266
How about it?

00:11:32.366 --> 00:11:37.496
Do you feel like listening to
what I have to say now?

00:11:39.033 --> 00:11:40.273
All I can tell you is this...

00:11:44.533 --> 00:11:46.333
I believe in Zola!

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:52.970
It looks like this is
going to take a while.

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:06.900
Okay, let's get going.

00:12:08.466 --> 00:12:11.526
We're going to save Kluke,
right, Zola?!

00:12:11.966 --> 00:12:14.526
Weren't you
listening yesterday?

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:15.570
Huh?

00:12:15.833 --> 00:12:17.403
We don't know where Kluke is.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:20.200
We can't set off if we don't know
where we're going.

00:12:20.433 --> 00:12:22.703
Huh? We still don't know?

00:12:23.266 --> 00:12:26.296
How could we know when
we don't have any clues?

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:28.570
Zola, where are
we going, maro?

00:12:29.166 --> 00:12:32.596
I told you.
We're going to the Sealed Grounds.

00:12:33.033 --> 00:12:34.133
Then...

00:12:34.333 --> 00:12:37.273
Knock it off!
What about Kluke?!

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:39.630
It's for her sake.

00:12:40.066 --> 00:12:40.726
Huh?!

00:12:41.033 --> 00:12:44.103
Do you think Logi
will just leave us alone?

00:12:44.933 --> 00:12:47.873
He'll definitely take
some kind of action against us.

00:12:48.633 --> 00:12:49.773
Wait until then.

00:12:50.366 --> 00:12:53.496
But...I can't go
along with that!

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:55.400
Grow up already!

00:12:56.600 --> 00:13:01.400
Acting based on emotions alone
leads to mistakes at key moments.

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:03.570
Zola...

00:13:05.233 --> 00:13:06.233
Got it?

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:08.470
That's not right!

00:13:08.966 --> 00:13:12.226
I've always acted according
to my beliefs.

00:13:13.066 --> 00:13:14.196
I want to protect everyone.

00:13:14.833 --> 00:13:16.933
I don't want the sadness
to spread any further...

00:13:18.033 --> 00:13:20.433
I've always stuck to my guns!

00:13:25.566 --> 00:13:27.596
And yet, why?

00:13:28.066 --> 00:13:29.466
Can't you understand?

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:34.470
This is the quickest way
for us to save Kluke.

00:13:35.233 --> 00:13:37.003
I can guarantee you that.

00:13:38.466 --> 00:13:40.826
Shu, have faith in me.

00:13:42.966 --> 00:13:43.966
Got it?

00:13:44.433 --> 00:13:45.433
Let's go...

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:47.700
to the Sealed Grounds.

00:13:49.633 --> 00:13:50.873
Kluke is our friend.

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:53.730
I'm sure Zola wants
to save her, too...

00:13:54.800 --> 00:13:56.170
I'll believe in Zola!

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:06.000
Guys...

00:14:13.133 --> 00:14:15.073
I brought you some food.

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:19.600
Eat up.

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:22.100
Thanks.

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:25.530
Don't worry.
It's not poisoned.

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:28.070
That's not what I was thinking.

00:14:28.933 --> 00:14:30.303
Then eat up.

00:14:30.933 --> 00:14:32.773
You haven't eaten anything
since yesterday, right?

00:14:34.566 --> 00:14:36.566
You're nice.

00:14:37.866 --> 00:14:39.066
W-What're you talking about?!

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:43.500
Thank you.

00:14:51.633 --> 00:14:53.103
W-What is it?!

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:56.030
What're you fighting for?

00:14:57.033 --> 00:14:57.703
Huh?

00:14:58.300 --> 00:14:59.400
That's easy.

00:15:00.333 --> 00:15:02.633
I'm fighting to get stronger.

00:15:04.533 --> 00:15:06.103
What'll you do once
you are stronger?

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:08.500
I can do anything
if I'm strong.

00:15:09.233 --> 00:15:13.973
If I'm stronger than anyone,
nobody can tell me what to do.

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:17.230
That's your reason to fight?

00:15:19.166 --> 00:15:20.666
Is that weird?

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:22.700
No, it's not.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.070
But it's kind of sad.

00:15:29.666 --> 00:15:31.896
Then why do you fight?!

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.200
I...

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:37.030
Money? Is it power?
You want to live an easy life?

00:15:37.666 --> 00:15:38.996
It's not like that.

00:15:39.166 --> 00:15:40.696
Then why?

00:15:41.866 --> 00:15:46.466
I...think I'm fighting
to help others...

00:15:47.166 --> 00:15:48.826
To...help?

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:52.130
I'm sure...that's my reason.

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:05.100
You're a clever kid.

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:09.630
Isn't it about time
you made a smart choice?

00:16:11.166 --> 00:16:17.966
Do you really think you acquire
that extra power through the Extra Seven

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:20.500
just to defeat Nene?

00:16:20.833 --> 00:16:22.303
Yes, of course!

00:16:22.533 --> 00:16:26.403
Then why do you guys still
continue on your journey?

00:16:26.633 --> 00:16:29.733
Well...
I'm sure it's to defeat you.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.070
That's not it.

00:16:31.466 --> 00:16:35.066
If that were the case,
you'd come straight to me.

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:39.870
In all likelihood,

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:44.500
she hasn't told you everything she
deciphered from the Extra Seven.

00:16:45.066 --> 00:16:46.896
And that's because there's
something in there

00:16:46.933 --> 00:16:48.673
she doesn't want you guys
to know about.

00:16:49.066 --> 00:16:52.566
Zola said she was trying to find out
the truth about Shadows.

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:55.100
Do you have any idea?

00:16:56.533 --> 00:16:58.133
I don't know.

00:16:59.166 --> 00:17:03.496
It seems you really don't
know anything about Zola.

00:17:04.966 --> 00:17:09.326
How can you travel with her when
you don't even know her at all?

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:12.530
How can you have
faith in Zola?

00:17:16.266 --> 00:17:18.926
You don't think
she's deceiving you?

00:17:22.233 --> 00:17:27.333
It's true that there are many things
I don't know about Zola.

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:34.100
But we've journeyed together
and fought together all this time.

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:38.800
Zola's my friend.
So I believe in her!

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:41.400
A friend.

00:17:44.333 --> 00:17:48.273
Then let me give you
a piece of information.

00:17:51.600 --> 00:17:52.600
Zola...

00:17:56.033 --> 00:17:59.173
is not a descendant
of the seven Soldiers of Light.

00:17:59.666 --> 00:18:00.396
What?!

00:18:09.166 --> 00:18:10.896
Why's Zola in
such a hurry?

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:13.630
It looks like she's anxious
about something...

00:18:14.800 --> 00:18:18.970
What is up ahead in
the Sealed Grounds?!

00:18:21.633 --> 00:18:22.803
That's a lie!

00:18:23.766 --> 00:18:25.066
Then let me ask you this...

00:18:25.733 --> 00:18:28.703
Did you see the Killer Bat's
ruins with your own eyes?

00:18:29.233 --> 00:18:33.273
Did you see the moment when Zola
attained her new power?

00:18:33.533 --> 00:18:38.733
There's no need to worry about me.
Killer Bat has already gained power.

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:41.430
I can tell by looking at you.

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:45.230
Zola didn't tell you
the truth about that.

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:49.770
Doesn't it mean that
she's hiding something?

00:18:52.633 --> 00:18:53.633
Well...

00:18:54.133 --> 00:18:57.733
We've been secretly
investigating the ruins

00:18:57.766 --> 00:19:01.526
and deciphering
the Extra Seven.

00:19:01.966 --> 00:19:04.426
As a result,
we've verified that Zola is

00:19:04.466 --> 00:19:07.626
not a descendant of
the Soldiers of Light.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:12.800
Zola hasn't told you everything
about the Extra Seven.

00:19:14.133 --> 00:19:15.373
I don't believe that.

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:19.300
You can take this
hypothetically.

00:19:19.666 --> 00:19:23.966
If Zola isn't a descendent
of the Soldiers of Light,

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:27.300
then what is she trying to do
by assembling you guys?

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:31.000
What in the world
is she after?

00:19:32.333 --> 00:19:35.433
Don't you think
it's frightening?

00:19:39.566 --> 00:19:40.926
I'll say it again.

00:19:41.566 --> 00:19:44.926
Zola is not a descendent
of the Soldiers of Light.

00:19:45.433 --> 00:19:47.473
That's...a lie...

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:54.270
What is she trying to do
in the Sealed Grounds?!

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:57.800
Answer me if you can.

00:20:05.733 --> 00:20:08.633
Zola...didn't tell us anything.

00:20:11.233 --> 00:20:14.103
Thanks.
We got some good information.

00:20:14.433 --> 00:20:15.103
Huh?

00:20:16.333 --> 00:20:18.603
Andropov,
take her back to her room.

00:20:19.333 --> 00:20:21.503
Schneider,
prepare for departure!

00:20:21.866 --> 00:20:22.526
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:34.430
General Logi,
what kind of information did we get?

00:20:34.966 --> 00:20:36.166
Don't you get it?

00:20:36.266 --> 00:20:37.496
N-No.

00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:42.530
Zola and the others are indeed
heading for the Sealed Grounds.

00:20:43.133 --> 00:20:46.303
But the informant
already told us that.

00:20:46.466 --> 00:20:50.596
The issue is that the informant's
information was correct.

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:53.570
How did information that
only they should know

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:55.630
make its way to the informant?

00:20:56.266 --> 00:20:57.266
That's right.

00:20:57.733 --> 00:21:03.203
In other words,
Zola is trying to lure us to that land.

00:21:04.466 --> 00:21:05.466
You're right.

00:21:05.833 --> 00:21:09.273
Fortunately,
we have that girl in our control...

00:21:09.866 --> 00:21:11.326
This is significant.

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:15.100
Zola...

00:21:15.266 --> 00:21:18.926
I told you I'm the one
in charge now.

00:21:28.366 --> 00:21:29.366
Schneider.

00:21:32.366 --> 00:21:33.366
What's up?

00:21:33.433 --> 00:21:36.433
Sorry. I've got something
I want to ask you.

00:21:36.866 --> 00:21:37.526
What is it?

00:21:38.566 --> 00:21:40.396
It's about that prisoner.

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:43.670
Oh, what about
that little girl?

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:47.000
What's going to
happen to her now?

00:21:47.533 --> 00:21:48.203
What is?

00:21:48.966 --> 00:21:52.596
Well, there's probably no way
she'll avoid being punished.

00:21:53.300 --> 00:21:54.300
Then...

00:21:55.066 --> 00:21:59.126
She's a Shadow Wielder
who did great harm to us.

00:21:59.700 --> 00:22:03.300
You can just imagine
what'll happen.

00:22:04.700 --> 00:22:05.770
I see.

00:22:18.200 --> 00:22:19.800
Checkmate...

00:22:21.300 --> 00:22:21.970
Zola!

00:22:28.333 --> 00:22:30.933
I'll save Kluke!

00:24:18.200 --> 00:24:20.400
Shu and Logi engage in
a fierce battle in the Sealed Grounds.

00:24:20.433 --> 00:24:22.573
Logi activates a new Shadow.

00:24:24.433 --> 00:24:27.233
That's Kluke.
Logi turned her into a Shadow...

00:24:27.266 --> 00:24:28.266
No way!

00:24:28.300 --> 00:24:30.430
She's got a better figure than me.

00:24:30.466 --> 00:24:31.566
She's naked, maro.

00:24:31.600 --> 00:24:33.500
The real me has awakened!

00:24:34.733 --> 00:24:36.733
Next on Blue Dragon:
Awakening
